# Reality Quest — environment variables
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# You do NOT need any of these. The app runs with zero configuration.
#
# Every external service used is a keyless public endpoint:
#   - OSM raster tiles   https://tile.openstreetmap.org
#   - Overpass API       https://overpass-api.de (and a mirror)
#   - Nominatim          https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org
#
# If you deploy a custom build with your own tile server or a hosted Overpass
# instance, add the overrides below. They are build-time Vite variables, so
# they must start with VITE_ to reach the browser bundle.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: replace the default OSM tile template.
# VITE_TILE_URL=https://your-tile-host/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; Your Tile Provider

# Optional: point at your own Overpass instance to avoid the public rate limits.
# VITE_OVERPASS_ENDPOINT=https://overpass.your-domain.example/api/interpreter

# Optional: point at your own Nominatim instance.
# VITE_NOMINATIM_ENDPOINT=https://nominatim.your-domain.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit a real .env file. It is already in .gitignore.
# This app has no server, no database and no secrets to configure.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
